  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A cooling, long-wearing eyeshadow stick that lasts up to 8 hours and delivers high-impact shimmer—without the irritation.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Biomimetic Sugar Complex: Addresses dryness and flakiness.</p><p>- Crystal Blend: Adds multidimensional shimmer.</p><p>- Irish Moss: Soothes skin and locks in moisture.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Made with a blend of superfine crystals and pearls—a safer alternative to glitter—this easy-to-use, water-based stick glides on smoothly, blends out beautifully, and has no fallout.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swipe or tap directly onto eyelids. <br>-Close cap tightly after use to prevent drying.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Biomimetic Sugar Complex: Addresses dryness and flakiness.<br>-Crystal Blend: Adds multidimensional shimmer.<br>-Irish Moss: Soothes skin and locks in moisture.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Propanediol, Calcium Sodium Borosilicate (In Avalon, Chateau, Roxy, Studio 28, Troubador, Viper, Bungalow, Garden), Chondrus Crispus (Carrageenan) Powder, Pentylene Glycol, Saccharide Isomerate, Hydroxyacetophenone, Calcium Chloride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol, Silica (In Avalon, Studio 28), Mica (In Studio 28), Calcium Aluminum Borosilicate (In Garden), Tetrasodium Glutamate Diacetate, Aminomethyl Propanediol, Aluminum Calcium Sodium Silicate (In Whisky), Tin Oxide (In Avalon, Chateau, Roxy, Troubador, Whisky, Viper, Bungalow, Garden), Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate. May Contain/Peut Contenir [+/-: Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
